      "text": "```\nTHE FIVE ELEMENTS OF PUNCH (sack = \"PLAT\"):\n  P - Potent (spirit: rum, brandy, arrack)\n  L - Lemon (acid: citrus juice)\n  A - Ambrosial (sugar: loaf sugar or syrup)\n  T - Tea (spice: nutmeg, allspice, or tea)\n  (Water: fifth element)"
